---
import Badge from '../ui/Badge.astro';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-y border-surface-border">
  <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Columna Texto Izquierda -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col items-start">
        <div class="mb-3">
          <Badge variant="mint">Ahorro con Propósito</Badge>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-content-primary leading-[1.18]">
          Convierte tus objetivos<br />
          <span class="spendly-gradient-text">en progreso visible.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 text-base sm:text-lg text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Define cuánto quieres ahorrar y sigue el avance de cada meta hasta alcanzarla, ya sea tu fondo de emergencia, vacaciones o una compra importante.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 w-full">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-cardSubtle border border-surface-border">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-content-secondary mb-1.5">
              <span>Fondo de Emergencia</span>
              <span class="text-spendly-700 font-bold">75% alcanzado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-surface-border rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden">
              <div class="bg-spendly-500 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 75%"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-content-secondary mt-2">Registra aportes individuales y observa tu meta acercarse día a día.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-cardSubtle border border-surface-border">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-content-primary">Visualiza el tiempo restante</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-content-secondary mt-1">
              Establece fechas estimadas para mantener el foco y saber con exactitud cuánto necesitas apartar cada mes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Visual Derecha -->
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-3 bg-surface-cardSubtle border border-surface-border shadow-soft-lg group">
          <img
            src="/images/gifs/spendly-goals-progress.gif"
            alt="Demostración dinámica de metas de ahorro progresivas en Spendly."
            width="640"
            height="480"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-soft transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-surface-border shadow-soft flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-spendly-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-content-primary">Progreso en Vivo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
